@page "/counter"
@rendermode InteractiveServer

<PageTitle>Counter</PageTitle>

<h1>Counter</h1>

<p>Trace of the <em>counter</em> example from <code>HtmlFlow-Datastar-Examples</code>.
In BRHC the counter is a <code>MutableStateFlow&lt;Int&gt;</code> on the server arriving over SSE
(<code>data-init @@get('/counter/events')</code>); here it is a C# field in the circuit and SignalR
delivers the render-tree diff on every click.</p>

<div class="demo-box">
    <p class="fs-3">Current count: <strong>@currentCount</strong></p>
    <button class="btn btn-primary" @onclick="() => currentCount++">Increment</button>
    <button class="btn btn-secondary" @onclick="() => currentCount--">Decrement</button>
</div>

@code {
    private int currentCount;
}
